  (1, 13, 40, 11, 'EU Foreign Policy: Challenges and Strategies', 'International Relations', 'The European Union plays an important role in global affairs. This lesson examines diplomatic relations, trade agreements, security partnerships, and the EU''s influence on international organizations and world events.', 'Advanced', 'Approved', 40, 40),
